      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "IANDRA GRACE (8) broke from a low draw and filled a minor placing last start, beaten only 1.5 lengths (19.50) behind Westside Tango at this track. Good beginner but will need a little luck early crossing from an outside draw. Rates highly and will give a great sight. GRACEFUL BANDIT (4) got off the mark with her maiden win two back, then finished a 2.25 lengths second last start at this track over 330m (19.13). Back to track where she won her maiden. Leading player again. CHASIN' LINDA (1) is not the most reliable at box rise. Latest effort finished 5th in a Grade 5 on October 27 over 320m at Wagga behind Tiny Bianca beaten 6 lengths (19.00). Looks well placed here and among the chances. STORM TRIO (2) defied the market to win last start and can go on with it.",
